@startuml ac_uc_3_3_etl_health

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  DiamondBackgroundColor #BBDEFB
  DiamondBorderColor #1565C0
}

title <size:18><b>UC-3.3 — View ETL Health</b></size>\nActivity Diagram

|Actor|
start
:Navigate to System Health\npage or Admin Home Dashboard;

|System|
if (ETL metadata\navailable?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Display indicator:\nETL metadata unavailable;
  stop
endif

:Retrieve ETL operational\nhealth data;

:Display ETL health information;
note right
  Information includes:
  - Last scheduled execution
  - Last successful execution
  - Execution duration
  - Data freshness
  - Channels processed
  - Successful / failed channels
  - Relevant error info
end note
note right: BR-019: No controls to trigger,\ncancel, retry, or modify\nETL configuration

|Actor|
:Review ETL operational health;
stop

@enduml
